---
import { ArrowRight, BookOpen, GitBranch, GitPullRequest } from '@lucide/astro';
---

<section id="contribute" class="contribute-section reveal" aria-labelledby="contribute-title">
  <div class="contribute-mark" aria-hidden="true"><GitPullRequest size={34} stroke-width={1.5} /></div>
  <div class="contribute-copy">
    <div class="section-kicker">07 / Open source</div>
    <h2 id="contribute-title">Make the next source easier to use.</h2>
    <p>Add a provider by extending <code>BaseProvider</code>, implementing its search, content, and resolution methods, then documenting and testing the adapter.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="contribute-actions">
    <a href="/docs/contributing/" class="action"><BookOpen size={15} aria-hidden="true" /> Read the contributor guide</a>
    <a href="https://github.com/hexxt-git/anime-sdk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="action action-secondary"><GitBranch size={15} aria-hidden="true" /> View source <ArrowRight size={14} aria-hidden="true" /></a>
  </div>
</section>
